  Personally,I don't see the point of having the mud if things stay as they are.**nae**To: wilbieRe:   StrikeCc: redsext, sargon, shadowmonk, nae, bobo, nunu, turbo, tinman, thumper, akira, nylakoorubDate: Mar 27jesus christ, this is such crap. i'm sorry, i try to stay out of politics, but tatsuo hasmanaged to brainwash people. so here's the deal, as faras i'm concerned.i'm gonna keep doing what i'm doing. coding, enjoying themud. it's a GAME!!!!!!! i have fun here.if you want to leave, then be my guest... *shurg* buta strike??? WHO FUCKING CARES????jesus, maybe i shouldnt mail when i'm drunk. but this is justsuch crap... whining about shit that tatsuo obviously has no clue about.wilbie, and whoever else supports this strike... i have a suggestion forya- go on strike. turn off your machine, get out into the world,and realize that there's more to it than this game. causethis game doesnt mean a damn thing.nae**mangla**To: sargonSubj: PromotionsCc: arches tinman shadowmonk brainsprain redsexy bobo turboDate: Mar 31As was promised, the promotions have been made.Thanks for your time and patience.-Mangla**turbo**To: manglaSubj: 208.138.204.10Cc: airborne, sauron, exos, sargonDate: Apr  1Perhaps a second site ban will keep the little rodent away from here.As the only person who logged in from Erie in YEARS, I see no problems with this.**turbo**To: manglaSubj: random list of cloneable itemsCc: sargonDate: Apr  4I am trying to make a random cloning of treasure for a mobFor details, see/p/t/monsters/artifact/teekas_dragon.cthank you**turbo**To: manglaSubj: /players/mangla/guild/obj/parry_shad.cCc: sargonDate: Apr  4When there is time, I need this broken down into english.**sargon**To: manglaSubj: Error in player objectCc: sargonDate: Apr  4HiWhen logging i was in a void.Tried to quit and got the following error message.Bad argument 1 to call_other()program: sys/player.cobject : sys/